{"description":"双Y轴的折线柱状图，是把用户数据需要展现的数据使用直观的柱状图和折线图进行展示。如果需要把数据进行汇总展示时可以把数据拖入柱状图槽位通过属性配置堆叠来达到数据汇总效果。可用应用同类数据明细汇总或对比，如某集团各销售部门一年中个月销售明细对比，及各部门销售额增长率通过同一图形来汇总展示。适用于金融、教育、制造业等行业数据统计比较。","keywords":["堆叠柱状图","折线图","柱状折线组合图","DoubleYaxis"],"tags":["pbiv-comparison","pbiv-correlation"],"pbivizUrl":"https://customvisualspackages.powerbi.com/publishedpackages/doubleYaxis4E8AA8C8152643CA8308FE2A54A98523.1.2.0.1.pbiviz","pbixUrl":"https://customvisualspackages.powerbi.com/publishedpackages/doubleYaxis4E8AA8C8152643CA8308FE2A54A98523.1.2.0.1.pbix","legalTermsUrl":"https://go.microsoft.com/fwlink/?linkid=2041178","privacyUrl":"https://biportalv2.chinacloudsites.cn/wcr/PrivacyStatement_doubleYaxis.pdf","supportUrl":"https://biportalv2.chinacloudsites.cn/wcr/SupportAndContact.pdf"}